,"Letters incised with a relatively broad tool, in single strokes without serfis, but with some extensions to strokes, e.g. at top of alpha. Alpha has straight bar. Epsilon has slightly shorter mid-stroke. Nu has diagonal starting and finishing part way down the verticals. Omicron and theta are slightly smaller than other characters. mu has straight lines, with the middle strokes joining slightly above the base line.",[49],{"type":50,"l":51,"from":52,"to":52,"h":53,"unit":54,"atLeast":55,"atMost":56},"letterHeight","Line 1","line1","4-9","mm","4","9",{"_":58,"notBefore":59,"notAfter":60,"evidence":61},"Later fourth or earlier third century BCE on the basis of the lettering (Brugnone). The type of incense burner has a long chronological span, and archaeological context is lacking.",-350,-251,"lettering",[63,68],{"_":64,"type":65,"ref":66,"region":67},"Selinus","ancient","https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462214","Sicilia",{"_":69,"type":70,"region":67},"Selinunte","modern",[72],[73,74],37.5853775,12.8298666,[],"Sicily","Palermo",{"_":79,"role":80,"ref":81},"Museo Archeologico Regionale Antonino Salinas","museum","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/064",{"_":83,"type":84},"62928","inventory",{"_":86,"mainLang":87,"languages":88},"Ancient Greek","grc",[86],{"n":90,"url":91,"height":92,"width":93,"desc":94,"surfaceType":95},"screen","ISic020942_tiled.tif","3680px","5520px","I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana","front",[97],{"atLeast":98,"atMost":99},4,9,[101],"Brugnone, 2018, Luoghi di vendita e santuari: a proposito di un incensiere iscritto da Selinunte",[103],"DLYP632X",[105,105,106,25,107,33,108,109,110,111,112,113,114,87],"isic020942",{"_":11},"incense burner","selinus","selinunte","sicilia","sicily","palermo","museo archeologico regionale antonino salinas","ancient greek","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\